  "contentHtml": "<p>물리2</p><p>&#160;포물선 운동 계산식 한 칠판과 함께 잠깨는 용도로 썼습니다. ~^^</p><p>&#160;</p><p>슬로우 모션으로 수업시간에 바로 찍고 공유했더니,&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>현장감을 느꼈는지 아이들 반응이 좋았습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&quot;우리가 원하든 원하지 않든, 모든 물체는 물리의 법칙에 따라 움직인단다.. &quot;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>멘트와 함께~^^</p><p>&#160;</p><p>아래 동영상은&#160; tracker 프로그램의 잔상기능을 이용해 편집한 것입니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d49d1a33e8b791b05693e9d207cea14420bdd595\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d49d1a33e8b791b05693e9d207cea14420bdd595\" data-orgin-width=\"1699\" data-origin-height=\"906\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>tracker 프로그램의 &quot;잔상&quot;필터(0.1)를 이용한 것입니다.&#160; (<a href=\"https://physlets.org/tracker/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://physlets.org/tracker/</a>)</p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvxia56v3vfhucgb8fbqqvya3@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"712\" data-video-height=\"400\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/thumb/S712x400/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Fthumb.kakaocdn.net%2Fdna%2Fkamp%2Fsource%2Frvxia56v3vfhucgb8fbqqvya3%2Fthumbs%2F2.jpg%3Fcredential%3DTuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK%26expires%3D33174111602%26signature%3Ds9QT0ldGSTnz17A7%252BnLT6j%252F8juA%253D\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"712\" data-video-origin-height=\"400\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvxia56v3vfhucgb8fbqqvya3?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2eGlhNTZ2M3ZmaHVjZ2I4ZmJxcXZ5YTMiLCJ0aWQiOiJkZDc2M2I3Yi1jY2Y5LTQ1MDQtYTJhMi0wODAxYjIzZTliMTQiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxODczNDV9.8_5rbqjEgSXOCYUFMBcbcvIJT2vz8pKnxZPMuaJT4U-mbEKM5Ew-Y4zrdIijp936ET1YZ5PIrg76tO1LAFGFPw&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"712\" height=\"400\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>슬로우모션으로 찍은 영상 입니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvwcgolfl3axtbvdcb7lgc4qz@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"712\" data-video-height=\"400\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/thumb/S712x400/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Fthumb.kakaocdn.net%2Fdna%2Fkamp%2Fsource%2Frvwcgolfl3axtbvdcb7lgc4qz%2Fthumbs%2F2.jpg%3Fcredential%3DTuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK%26expires%3D33174112234%26signature%3D8FiBJeIeTh5HC5tRRCgk7CikCeE%253D\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"712\" data-video-origin-height=\"400\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvwcgolfl3axtbvdcb7lgc4qz?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2d2Nnb2xmbDNheHRidmRjYjdsZ2M0cXoiLCJ0aWQiOiIzNTM3MTQzYy02YmExLTQxNmItOTE2YS1hZjQ2ZjRjMzhhZDUiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxODczNDV9.yxT6gNT6CfcdXsBpTxE4Yl5YCkpXKQSS2tijPPqAGRy0zRE9xKOhoax4KT-N9C5AtfSUYxkLCvC-gZcO5qX-hw&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"712\" height=\"400\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>아래 제품은 오픈 마켓에서, 약 3~4만원정도입니다... 세기 조절이 가능합니다.</p><p>쿠*에서 &quot;반려견 공놀이 공발사 장난감&quot;라고 검색~^^</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9ed7d7d7f2073a75bcc67e9fcab20baed6f59fe5\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9ed7d7d7f2073a75bcc67e9fca